<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49177" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρῑπήδεστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρίψ, ἐδήδεσμαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worm-eaten</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.14.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1628.163
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				1672.306
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραῖαι θριπήδεσται</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1628.205
			</span></i>, but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1629.328
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφραγίδια θ</span>. seals <i>made of
				worm-eaten wood</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				427
			</span></i>, cf. Sch. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			metaph.,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεφθαρμένη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				82
			</span></i>. (Freq. corrupted to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατος</span>, as in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
			</span></i>l.c. (ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
			</span></i> l.c. (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				13
			</span></i> (v.l.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.Gr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				205
			</span></i>, but a 
				Sup.
			 is never necessary exc. in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.8.5
			</span></i> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θριπώδης</span>).)</div>
